OL,3,GNEWSAGirl's 'calm' actions during
OL,4,Ateacher's seizure praised
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn 11-year-old girl has been praised
OL,7,Ffor her quick thinking and composure
OL,8,Fafter helping her teacher who was
OL,9,Fhaving a seizure in the classroom.
OL,11,FTom Ray began to feel unwell during a
OL,12,Fmaths lesson before suffering an
OL,13,Fepileptic seizure and losing
OL,14,Fconsciousness.
OL,16,FWhile some pupils thought he was
OL,17,Fjoking, Lily-Mae - who has been a Sea
OL,18,FCadet for three years and has had some
OL,19,Ffirst aid training - immediately
OL,20,Frealised something was seriously wrong.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,406,400,260,160,0,100
