OL,3,GNEWSAGirl's 'calm' actions during
OL,4,Ateacher's seizure praised
OL,5,
OL,6,F"At first we all thought it was a joke
OL,7,Fbut then Mr Ray started losing focus
OL,8,Fand he hit his head on the whiteboard,
OL,9,Fand I knew he doesn't really joke like
OL,10,Fthat," she said.
